 are endless party combinations to make! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up your Heroes</strong> -  Earn XP, level up, assign skill points and unlock the legendary skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equippable skills</strong> - Move skills between heroes, adjust strategies, and create endless unique builds on the fly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic book Campaign</strong> - Play through an incredible adventure to save the world\u2026 complete with  voice acted, animated comic book cutscenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> - Procedurally generated encounters that keep even the mightiest of heroes on their toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane bosses</strong> - They\u2019re big! They\u2019re bad! They\u2019re the ultimate challenge for your heroes each with hand animated cartoon attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoon soundtrack by Brad Breek</strong> - Guaranteed to get stuck in your head! Reminiscent of the catchiest theme songs from Saturday Morning Cartoons. From the composer of Gravity Falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue Rifters</strong> - A nefarious group of mysterious characters who live in the Rift. Here to help you out\u2026 for a price! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts</strong> - Legendary artifacts discarded in the Rift grant your heroes powerful blessings\u2014or equally devastating curses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856450/extras/d84df2910eccd8b998a60df540a4ff46.poster.avif?t=1746057103\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856450/extras/d84df2910eccd8b998a60df540a4ff46.webm?t=1746057103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp